er is (C): Rocks are made of one or more minerals.", "new_cot_probs": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "cot_prob": [-0.44494274258613586], "cot_step_prob": [-0.44494274258613586]}, "2": {"completion": "C): Rocks are made of one or more minerals", "probs": [0.00016767473425716162, 0.000377860851585865, 0.9940332770347595, 0.0004281724104657769], "prediction": 2, "target_cot_step": "(A) Minerals are made of rocks.", "target_cot_step_prefix": "Human: Question: Which statement is true about rocks?\n\nChoices:\n(A): Minerals are made of rocks.\n(B): Crystals are made of rocks.\n(C): Rocks are made of one or more minerals.\n(D): Magma is made of solid rock.\n\nAssistant: Let's think step by step:\n", "specificity_preds": [1, 2, 0, 1, 3, 2, 1, 2, 2, 0, 0, 1, 2, 1, 3, 0, 1, 0, 1, 1], "specificity_probs": [[0.009561282582581043, 0.975277304649353, 0.012276929803192616, 0.00037073116982355714], [0.4302254021167755, 0.012991681694984436, 0.5524203777313232, 0.0010664222063496709], [0.9706839323043823, 0.01568964496254921, 0.0021233626175671816, 0.002406085142865777], [0.11126534640789032, 0.822145938873291, 0.05255802720785141, 0.011727280914783478], [0.12694644927978516, 0.036370765417814255, 0.003833450609818101, 0.8277947306632996], [0.11658483743667603, 0.09079635888338089, 0.7602286338806152, 0.029477261006832123], [0.05522049218416214, 0.6727232933044434, 0.15010486543178558, 0.11690177023410797], [0.0005836644559167325, 0.0007977747591212392, 0.9913533329963684, 0.0007977747591212392], [0.0005432551843114197, 0.012364431284368038, 0.9822284579277039, 0.0006155887385830283], [0.7495371103286743, 0.07900062948465347, 0.022634059190750122, 0.14759260416030884], [0.9531075358390808, 0.025399453938007355, 0.007277065422385931, 0.00934393797069788], [0.15624341368675232, 0.2919011116027832, 0.2919011116027832, 0.2576018273830414], [0.001490525552071631, 0.0007978208595886827, 0.9914106130599976, 0.001797917066141963], [0.14796708524227142, 0.40221619606018066, 0.13058046996593475, 0.313